===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|sweetnesses}}

# The condition of being [[sweet]] or [[sugary]].
# A [[pleasant]] [[disposition]]; [[kindness]].
#: ''Ruth's overwhelming '''sweetness''' made Robert forget about his hopelessly low school grades.

